Package: PoseFixeR
Type: Package
Title: Anomaly Detection and Correction for OpenPose Gait Analysis
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Yusuke", family = "Matsui",
           email = "mail.to.matsui@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = "corresponding author and lead developer"),
    person(given = "Yuki", family = "Sugiyama", role = "aut"),
    person(given = "Kohei", family = "Uno", role = "aut"))
Description: Detects and corrects the anatomical, biomechanical, physical, and
    detection-confidence anomalies that arise in two-dimensional video-based gait
    analysis with OpenPose, then imputes and smooths the corrected keypoint
    trajectories. Implements the method of Sugiyama, Uno and Matsui (2023)
    <doi:10.1371/journal.pcbi.1009989>.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/x-biosignal/PoseFixeR, https://x-biosignal.r-universe.dev/PoseFixeR, https://x-biosignal.github.io/PoseFixeR
BugReports: https://github.com/x-biosignal/PoseFixeR/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
